## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `claude-sonnet-5` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Anthropic announced Claude Sonnet 5 on 2026-06-30 as a more agentic Sonnet model (`claude-sonnet-5`) positioned close to Opus 4.8 at lower cost, with availability across Claude plans and API pricing reported as $2/$10 per 1M tokens (announcement notes pricing/tokenizer details). Artificial Analysis lists Claude Sonnet 5 (Max) as a proprietary reasoning model with 1M context window, text+image input, text output, and pricing around $2/$10 (snapshot). OpenRouter lists `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5` with provider routing and API capabilities.
- The Anthropic announcement references benchmark comparisons (e.g. BrowseComp, OSWorld-Verified, Humanity's Last Exam, SWE-bench Verified, MRCR v2, GDPval-AA, etc.) and links to the Claude Sonnet 5 system card, but accessible fetched text did not provide extractable numeric benchmark scores for this exact model (charts/tables/images in announcement; system card fetched as unsupported PDF content type in this environment). Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

